AlterStmt {

  Alter Account AlterObjectAction |
  Alter Session AlterSessionAction |
  Alter Warehouse IfExists? ObjName? AlterWarehouseAction |
  Alter Table IfExists? ObjName AlterTableAction |
  Alter View IfExists? ObjName AlterViewAction |
  Alter Task IfExists? ObjName AlterTaskAction |
  Alter (Function | Procedure) ObjName UdfTypeSig AlterObjectAction |
  Alter GenericAlterObjectType IfExists? ObjName AlterObjectAction

}


